{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_011q43c8NR2mnCHSMvdcP1Fe","type":"tool_result","content":"| P2 | `png_process_data` + interlace | Adam7 input, `png_progressive_combine_row` in the row callback | [ ] |\n| P3 | `png_process_data_pause` | pause with save=0 and save=1 at every chunk boundary | [ ] |\n| P4 | `png_process_data_skip` | after a paused unknown/large chunk | [ ] |\n| P5 | progressive + transforms | `png_set_expand`, `gray_to_rgb`, `strip_16`, `packing`, gamma set in the info callback | [ ] |\n| P6 | progressive + multi-IDAT / zero-length IDAT | IDAT split into 1-byte chunks | [ ] |\n| P7 | progressive + ancillary chunks | all-chunk image, unknown chunk handling, user chunk callback | [ ] |\n| P8 | `png_get_progressive_ptr` | pointer round trip | [ ] |\n\n## S — simplified API (`pngread.c` / `pngwrite.c` simplified sections)\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [ ] |\n|---|----------------|--------------------------------------------|-----|\n| S1 | `png_image_begin_read_from_memory` + `png_image_finish_read` | every input colour type/depth × output format GRAY/GA/AG/RGB/BGR/RGBA/ARGB/BGRA/ABGR | [ ] |\n| S2 | same, LINEAR formats | LINEAR_Y / LINEAR_Y_ALPHA / LINEAR_RGB / LINEAR_RGB_ALPHA (16-bit output) | [ ] |\n| S3 | same, COLORMAP formats | RGB/BGR/RGBA/ARGB/BGRA/ABGR + colormap, `colormap_entries` | [ ] |\n| S4 | `png_image_finish_read` with background | `png_color` background × alpha-bearing input × row_stride negative (bottom-up) | [ ] |\n| S5 | `png_image_write_to_memory` | every format × `convert_to_8_bit` 0/1 × colormap, two-pass size query (`memory=NULL`) | [ ] |\n| S6 | `png_image_begin_read_from_stdio` / `png_image_write_to_stdio` / `..._to_file` | real temporary files | [ ] |\n| S7 | `png_image_free` | after success, after failure, twice | [ ] |\n\n## M — cross-cutting state / modes\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [ ] |\n|---|----------------|--------------------------------------------|-----|\n| M1 | `png_set_benign_errors(0/1)` | read and write structs, driven into a benign-error condition | [ ] |\n| M2 | `png_set_error_fn` with NULL / non-NULL callbacks | `png_get_error_ptr` round trip; default handler path | [ ] |\n| M3 | `png_set_mem_fn`, `png_get_mem_ptr` | user memory on read and write, `png_malloc` failure injection | [ ] |\n| M4 | `png_set_longjmp_fn` | jmp_buf sizes: equal to `sizeof(jmp_buf)`, smaller, larger (allocated) | [ ] |\n| M5 | write → read round trip | every colour/depth/interlace combination, image content preserved | [ ] |\n| M6 | `png_read_png`/`png_write_png` paired | all transform bits, round trip | [ ] |\n| M7 | `png_handle_as_unknown`, `png_set_keep_unknown_chunks` interaction | every keep value with an all-chunk image | [ ] |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Q6KZeTob5KWmg2bn2G4oMT","session_id":"11547ad3-7cdc-4bcb-a504-9e6a5631306e","uuid":"9f398828-a70f-4c94-9215-0e598edfdcc7","timestamp":"2026-08-14T15:45:15.994Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Write simplified API tests S1-S7"}
