te_info_struct` on a NULL png_ptr,\n  `png_info_init_3` with a wrong `png_info` size\n* `png_set_sig_bytes` with 9, -1; `png_sig_cmp` with num_to_check 0 and start > 7\n* `png_error`/`png_warning`/`png_chunk_error`/`png_chunk_warning`/`png_benign_error`/\n  `png_app_error`/`png_app_warning`/`png_chunk_report` called DIRECTLY with a NULL png_ptr and\n  with a valid one (the exported error API is part of the surface — `png_chunk_report` takes an\n  `int error` selector: cover PNG_CHUNK_WARNING/ERROR/WRITE_ERROR and an out-of-range value);\n  `png_longjmp` with a struct that has no jmp_buf; `png_set_longjmp_fn` with a jmp_buf size\n  smaller/larger than `sizeof(jmp_buf)` and called twice with different sizes\n  (\"Libpng jmp_buf still allocated\", \"Application jmp_buf size changed\")\n* colorspace: `png_set_gAMA`/`_fixed` with 0 and out-of-range values, `png_set_cHRM`/`_fixed`/\n  `_XYZ`/`_XYZ_fixed` with invalid/degenerate chromaticities (negative, zero sums, out of the\n  representable range), `png_set_sRGB` with intent < 0 / > 3, `png_set_sRGB_gAMA_and_cHRM` after\n  an iCCP, `png_set_iCCP` with a bad keyword / bad profile (every `png_icc_check_*` message that\n  is reachable from `png_set_iCCP`), setting both sRGB and iCCP, setting cHRM inconsistent with\n  sRGB (\"inconsistent chromaticities\"/\"ignoring incorrect cHRM\"), `png_set_cICP` with an invalid\n  matrix coefficient, `png_set_mDCV`/`_fixed` and `png_set_cLLI`/`_fixed` out of range\n* other `pngset.c` validation: `png_set_PLTE` num_palette out of range, `png_set_tRNS` num_trans\n  out of range, `png_set_sBIT` values 0 / > bit_depth, `png_set_hIST` without a palette,\n  `png_set_pCAL` bad equation type / negative nparams, `png_set_sCAL`/`_fixed`/`_s` with\n  0/negative/non-numeric, `png_set_pHYs`/`png_set_oFFs` bad unit, `png_set_eXIf_1` too short,\n  `png_set_text` with a bad keyword / bad compression value, `png_set_sPLT` bad depth/nentries,\n  `png_set_unknown_chunks` with an invalid chunk name and with