array` with negative/huge counts, `png_zalloc` overflow\n  (\"Potential overflow in png_zalloc()\"), and the `png_create_*_struct_2` allocation-failure path\n  via `with_session(|s| s.malloc_limit = Some(k))` for k = 0..5\n* Generic FFI boundary sweep: for EVERY function you touch, also call it with a NULL first\n  argument, and pass out-of-range values for every `int` parameter that the C compares against a\n  fixed set (C enums accept any int).\n  CAUTION: two upstream C functions genuinely dereference NULL (`png_process_data_skip(NULL)` and\n  `png_get_io_state(NULL)`) and would segfault the test process — skip those two, with a comment.\n\n## Rules\n\n* Use `diff(...)` for every input; a test passes when C and Rust behave identically, INCLUDING when\n  both reject. Compare state after the rejection too (log the relevant getters).\n* If they differ, KEEP the test, do NOT weaken it, do NOT `#[ignore]`, do NOT modify `src/`.\n  Report it precisely.\n* Never log a pointer/address — only null-ness, sizes, contents. Fixed seeds only.\n* Do NOT edit anything except your new `tests/err_api.rs`.\n* **`cargo test` does NOT rebuild the cdylib.** Always\n  `timeout 600 cargo build && timeout 600 cargo test --test err_api 2>&1 | tail -40`.\n* Runtime under ~120 s.\n\n## Self-check before reporting\n\n```bash\ncd /local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-4DaaTZ\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ntodo=[l.split('| \"')[1].rstrip('\"\\n') for l in open('tmp/todo2_api.txt') if '| \"' in l]\nobs=open('translated_rust/target/testsupport/observed_msgs.txt').read()\nmiss=[t for t in todo if t and t.split('  ')[0] not in obs]\nprint('triggered', len(todo)-len(miss), 'of', len(todo)); print('\\n'.join(miss))\nEOF\n```\nIterate until the missing list contains only rows you can justify as unreachable through the public\nAPI (give the reason for each). Aim for ≥ 85 %.\n\nFINAL REPORT: test fns + pass/fail, the coverage number, the justified-unreachable list, and every\nC-vs-Rust divergence found, precisely.","outputFile":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-4DaaTZ/tmp/claude-31072124/-local-home-scheschb--harvest-work-harvest-work-4DaaTZ-translated-rust/11547ad3-7cdc-4bcb-a504-9e6a5631306e/tasks/a5169172890ab2e56.output","canReadOutputFile":true}}
