NOT edit anything except your new `tests/modes.rs`.\n* **`cargo test` does NOT rebuild the cdylib.** Always\n  `timeout 600 cargo build && timeout 600 cargo test --test modes 2>&1 | tail -40`.\n* Runtime under ~120 s.\n\nFINAL REPORT: per test fn — pass/fail, and for each failure the exact C-vs-Rust trace difference\nplus the triggering configuration."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4115,"cache_read_input_tokens":362049,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4115,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"11547ad3-7cdc-4bcb-a504-9e6a5631306e","uuid":"9ed8bdee-22ad-4301-bcec-3eb276005a1d","timestamp":"2026-08-14T17:12:26.544Z"}
